   Well, I finally got back to creating NetHack patches. This one,
"xorn343", fixes three bugs in NH343. Of course, they're probably already
fixed in the upcoming version, but if not... DevTeam, please steal them!

   (1) Engraving while embedded in solid rock (e.g., while a Xorn) gives
the message "You can't engrave in the solid rock!" instead of allowing
you to engrave "in the dust".

   (2) Engraving while underwater gives the message "You can't write
underwater!" instead of "You can't write on the water!".

   (3) Casting Protection to get a "golden haze" now produces accurate
messages while embedded in solid rock, or swallowed, or engulfed by a
vortex or fog cloud.

